# Lieutenant Hikaru Sulu: "Whenever Lieutenant Sulu becomes tapped, he explores." (CR 701.44a, 603.2) He is tapped by being declared
# as an attacker (CR 508.1f), and explores twice: on turn 3 the revealed Forest is a land card and goes into the hand with no
# counter; on turn 5 the revealed Lightning Bolt is a nonland card, so he gets a +1/+1 counter and Bot1 puts it into the graveyard.

